# Anti-scraping / hardening (#59, MT 6 Nov 2026). Header-only: no Cache-Control here, so no rule merges with the cache rules above.
# X-Frame-Options SAMEORIGIN (not DENY): app pages embed same-site pages in iframes.
# CSP intentionally not added yet: it needs a Report-Only trial first.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), payment=(), geolocation=(self)
# Keep search engines and AI crawlers out of app data, assets and the API.
/app/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive
